#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid ""
"Click on the measuring cylinder containing sodium sulphate solution to pour "
"it into the conical flask."
msgstr ""
"Click on the measuring cylinder containing sodium sulphate solution to pour "
"it into the conical flask."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid ""
"Click on the measuring cylinder containing barium chloride solution to pour "
"it into the 10 ml test tube."
msgstr ""
"Click on the measuring cylinder containing barium chloride solution to pour "
"it into the 10 ml test tube."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "Click on the thread to tie the test tube with it."
msgstr "Click on the thread to tie the test tube with it."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "Click on the test tube to hang it in the conical flask."
msgstr "Click on the test tube to hang it in the conical flask."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid ""
"Click on the conical flask to place it on the balance and weigh it with all "
"the contents and note the reading."
msgstr ""
"Click on the conical flask to place it on the balance and weigh it with all "
"the contents and note the reading."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "Click on the information icon to view the  inference."
msgstr "Click on the information icon to view the  inference."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid ""
"Sodium sulphate solution reacts with barium chloride solution to form a "
"white precipitate of barium sulphate and an aqueous solution of sodium "
"chloride."
msgstr ""
"Sodium sulphate solution reacts with barium chloride solution to form a "
"white precipitate of barium sulphate and an aqueous solution of sodium "
"chloride."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid ""
"Since the mass of the total apparatus remains the same before and after the "
"reaction, the total mass of the reactants = the total mass of the products. "
"Hence the law of conservation of mass is verified."
msgstr ""
"Since the mass of the total apparatus remains the same before and after the "
"reaction, the total mass of the reactants = the total mass of the products. "
"Hence the law of conservation of mass is verified."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "Click on the 'NEXT STEP' button to redirect the next step"
msgstr "Click on the 'NEXT STEP' button to redirect the next step"

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid ""
"Click on the conical flask to tilt and swirl it to mix both the solutions."
msgstr ""
"Click on the conical flask to tilt and swirl it to mix both the solutions."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "Click on the conical flask to weigh it again an note the reading."
msgstr "Click on the conical flask to weigh it again an note the reading."

#: simcontrols.js:20
msgid "Wait for ten minutes to complete the reaction."
msgstr "Wait for ten minutes to complete the reaction."

